# UAV vertical takeoff path (same climb profile as
# ../uav_path_takeoff/uav_takeoff_path.dat): hold near ground, climb,
# hold at altitude. x/z fixed -- any downstream wake deflection seen in
# this case's diagnostics comes purely from the mean crosswind, not from
# horizontal disk motion.
# t [s]   x [m]   y [m]   z [m]
0.00      0.5     0.30    0.5
0.05      0.5     0.30    0.5
0.25      0.5     1.50    0.5
0.40      0.5     1.50    0.5
